  <name>FoxRes</name>
  <summary>Resistor color codes, SMD markings and standard values</summary>
  <description>
    <p>FoxRes is a fast, exact resistor calculator for anyone who builds or repairs electronics.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Decode 3, 4, 5 and 6-band color codes, or type a value such as 4k7 to get its bands</li>
      <li>Read and generate SMD markings: 3-digit, 4-digit, R notation and EIA-96</li>
      <li>Find the nearest E3 to E192 standard value, with the values either side</li>
      <li>Find the best series or parallel pair of standard values for any target</li>
      <li>Use every calculation from the command line, with JSON output for scripts</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Every color code and every SMD code is checked by exhaustive tests, and the E-series tables
    are verified against IEC 60063.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.foxiq.FoxRes.desktop</launchable>
  <developer id="io.foxiq">
